   "spoken": "The pawn to e6 is the solid main line, reaching a famous, deeply-studied theoretical position — Black shores up d5 and prepares normal development.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "e6 is the reliable Alapin main line, a sound small-centre setup for Black.",
   "plans": "Develop harmoniously; White will manoeuvre for the squeeze."
