   "line": [
    "Nc4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight route to a3 and then c4 is the heart of White's squeeze — heading for the b6- and d6-outposts and cramping Black's queenside. This is how you throttle the Sicilian slowly.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "The Na3-Nc4 manoeuvre targets b6/d6 — a positional clamp on Black's queenside.",
   "plans": "Land the knight on c4 and press the weak dark squares."
  },
